OL,3,GNEWSAScotland 'not like Manchester',
OL,4,ASwinney says in dig at PM Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwinney made further pledges to extend
OL,7,Fa #2 bus fare cap to the north east of
OL,8,FScotland, launch an independence
OL,9,Fcampaign, fund anti-racism initiatives
OL,10,Fand tackle misogyny in schools.
